place_id:ChIJr26A65zHxokRQ5CUIzVlxT4,ChIJr26A65zHxokRQ5CUIzVlxT4,0x89c6c79ceb806eaf:0x3ec5653523949043,Ben's Fast Food,"3300 Fairmount Ave, Philadelphia, PA 19104",⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Rated 4.8/5.0 from 150+ reviews,"We’re here because we believe everyone deserves access to real food: meals that are healthy, craveable, and affordable.",,38,USD,https://bensfastfood.com/locations/philadelphia?utm_source=gmb&utm_medium=organic,html_heuristic,"Ben’s Fast Food in Philadelphia is open for delivery and takeout at 3300 Fairmount Ave—right at the crossroads of Fairmount, Mantua, and the edge of Brewerytown. We’re here because we believe everyone deserves access to real food: meals that are healthy, craveable, and affordable. No frills, no dining room—just fast, fresh options made to fuel your day. Whether you’re heading home from a shift at Penn Presbyterian, walking back from Kelly Drive, or catching your breath after a run past the old railway cut under 31st Street, we’ve got something satisfying waiting for you. This part of Philly ha"
