place_id:ChIJT-M4LdnFxokRICuafLb1PzY,ChIJT-M4LdnFxokRICuafLb1PzY,0x89c6c5d92d38e34f:0x363ff5b67c9a2b20,China House No. 5,"2437 S 24th St #8A, Philadelphia, PA 19145",About the Menu,The menu at China House No.,"offers a straightforward yet satisfying selection of classic Chinese dishes that feel just right for casual dining or takeout. You’ll find familiar favorites like fried chicken wings, orange chicken, and wonton soup alongside a variety of fried or steamed dumplings and savory fried rice options. ...",5,USD,https://china-house-no-5.placejoys.com/menu,html_heuristic,"The menu at China House No. 5 offers a straightforward yet satisfying selection of classic Chinese dishes that feel just right for casual dining or takeout. You’ll find familiar favorites like fried chicken wings, orange chicken, and wonton soup alongside a variety of fried or steamed dumplings and savory fried rice options. These dishes fit naturally into everyday moments—whether it’s a quick lunch, a relaxed family dinner, or a comforting meal after a busy day."
place_id:ChIJT-M4LdnFxokRICuafLb1PzY,ChIJT-M4LdnFxokRICuafLb1PzY,0x89c6c5d92d38e34f:0x363ff5b67c9a2b20,China House No. 5,"2437 S 24th St #8A, Philadelphia, PA 19145",About the Menu,The atmosphere at China House No.,"pairs well with its menu: simple, warm, and unpretentious. The food arrives fresh and thoughtfully prepared, reflecting a balance between homestyle flavors and well-loved Chinese-American staples. Menu highlights such as crab ragoon, Singapore chow mei fun, and pepper steak with onions invite you...",5,USD,https://china-house-no-5.placejoys.com/menu,html_heuristic,"The atmosphere at China House No. 5 pairs well with its menu: simple, warm, and unpretentious. The food arrives fresh and thoughtfully prepared, reflecting a balance between homestyle flavors and well-loved Chinese-American staples. Menu highlights such as crab ragoon, Singapore chow mei fun, and pepper steak with onions invite you to enjoy a relaxed pace, savoring textures and familiar tastes without fuss."
